{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slavic Winter</strong>\u00a0<strong>Simulator</strong> is an authentic experience that recreates the celebration of New Year among residents of the post-Soviet space in the 2000s, offering nostalgic emotions. Throw snowballs at your in-game friends, enjoy the magical atmosphere of New Year from the 2000s, and relive the carefree days of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> on Unreal Engine, utilizing photogrammetry and Nanite technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A courtyard, stairwell, and several apartments to explore</strong>. No loading screens, just a single seamless world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light up sparklers, launch fireworks</strong>. To light a sparkler, hold it to a working gas stove burner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on a console</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb into other people's apartments via balconies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knock on neighbors' doors and wish them a Happy New Year</strong>. You can knock on over 30 apartments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All items in the apartment are interactive</strong>: TV, gas stove, water taps, light switches, cupboards, doors, clothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before leaving the house, you need to put on shoes and a jacket</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can wear a Christmas hat of Grandfather Frost / Santa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can eat tangerines, pies, and cakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can throw snowballs at the guys in the yard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars drive along the streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you throw a snowball at a car, its alarm will go off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The magical atmosphere of childhood New Year celebrations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Views from the windows of panel buildings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D graphics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fish-eye&quot;, &quot;VHS&quot;, and pixel art modes</strong>.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Snejki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1519150/333490a3632643a25628a26c40add0d561ce2479.jpg"},{"name":"Bandit ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1519150/1c2bbffa98dba5b42fce69695d5995cb4e814694.jpg"},{"name":"Fireworks ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1519150/2b156ad69a8fc10a713899c5beeb7f84f0370daf.jpg"},{"name":"Ohayo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1519150/74f8f162c9cb482df1891dd3521f4c2d84cfbb53.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1519150?t=1753212690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1519150?t=1753212690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519150/abf72af6e6a39aab48d5be51a9f5a089f5f4d2d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753212690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519150/abf72af6e6a39aab48d5be51a9f5a089f5f4d2d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753212690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_des