 you throw a snowball at a car, its alarm will go off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The magical atmosphere of childhood New Year celebrations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Views from the windows of panel buildings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D graphics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Fish-eye&quot;, &quot;VHS&quot;, and pixel art modes</strong>.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dobry Snegovik Studio","Average Winter Enjoyers"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519150/header.jpg?t=1753212690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1519150/833132/5f5eb2f224c2293243befb2a28fd52b923c37d77/1750998117/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740158870","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1519150/833132/5f5eb2f224c2293243befb2a28fd52b923c37d77/1750998117/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740158870","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1519150/833132/5f5eb2f224c2293243befb2a28fd52b923c37d77/1750998117/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740158870","id":257100895,"name":"2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100895/068b815b2f880e6e9bd8eb42c331e65ca2653bed/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740158870"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1519150/804505/7bd8238034497e003577d45fa5ed9091163db9ca/1750998116/dash_av1.mpd?t=1735151737","dash_h264":"h